  The operation casts `x` (in case of `Tensor`) or `x.values`
  (in case of `SparseTensor` or `IndexedSlices`) to `dtype`.

  For example:

  >>> x = tf.constant([1.8, 2.2], dtype=tf.float32)
  >>> tf.cast(x, tf.int32)
  <tf.Tensor: shape=(2,), dtype=int32, numpy=array([1, 2], dtype=int32)>

